      "problem": "Let $V={R}_{2}[t]$ be the vector space of all polynomials of degree at most $2$, equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x(t),y(t)⟩=x(-1)y(-1)+x(0)y(0)+x(1)y(1).\n$$\n\n Find $⟨x(t),y(t)⟩$, if\n\n$$\nx(t)=5-2t+{t}^{2},\\,y(t)=t-1.\n$$",
